  (text "GPS2 socket: pin 2 = Teensy RX2 (pin 7), pin 3 = Teensy TX2 (pin 8). On the Teensy it is Serial2." (at 25.40 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 248db7dd-86e2-4037-8247-1c7fc060e7de))
  (text "Power: the 3.3 V of the socket (the board's 1 A K7803M regulator) goes into the XIAO 3V3 pin. Do not plug in the XIAO USB-C with the adapter on the board." (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dd722c53-1077-4bd2-a4ed-ba23962f9b43))
  (text "R1 and R2: 100 ohm in series on the serial lines (protection). On the ESP32-C3: Serial0 = D6 TX (GPIO21) and D7 RX (GPIO20)." (at 25.40 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d72d896a-65c9-41f0-8f5a-3df17df63dba))
  (text "Not connected: pins 6 to 8 (F9P USB), 16 (wired to the GPS1 socket), 18 (LED RTK_STAT_1) and the other NC pins." (at 25.40 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f6317fd4-d1ce-4438-aeaf-20d2aa4a75fa))
  (text "J1 = socket pins 1-10, J2 = socket pins 11-20 (J2 pin 1 = socket pin 11). Both are 1x10 2.00 mm male headers on the bottom side." (at 25.40 46.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0cd89468-caa3-48e2-bcbf-3a7640d0d35c))

